  "content_text": "\r\n    \r\n        \r\n    \r\n    \r\n        \n            Manhattan Active SCALE Documentation\r\n        Welcome to the SDK\r\n    \r\n    \r\n         \n                Collapse All\n                Expand All\n            \r\n        View with Navigation Tools\r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \r\n        Welcome to the Manhattan SCALE Software Development Kit (SDK).\r\n\r\nCopyright Notice\r\n\r\nUsing the SDK Documentation\r\n\r\nThis documentation contains API reference topics and feature overviews for the programming elements available in Manhattan SCALE. To locate the topics you need, you can use Search, Index, the Table of Contents, or the navigational topics in the documentation viewer. You can browse API reference topics using the hierarchy in the Table of Contents.\r\n\r\nTroubleshooting\r\n\r\nIf this SDK is viewed over a network and will not show any topic content, please refer to the following Microsoft Knowledge Base article for information on the cause and any possible solutions: http://support.microsoft.com/kb/892675\n            \n            \r\n        \r\n    \r\n    \r\n        \n  ©2026 Manhattan Associates. All Rights Reserved.\n\r\n    \r\n    \r\n\r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \r\n",
  "search_text": "\r\n    \n\r\n        \r\n    \n\r\n    \n\r\n        \n            \nManhattan Active SCALE Documentation\n\r\n        \n\nWelcome to the SDK\n\n\r\n    \n\r\n    \n\r\n         \n                Collapse All\n                Expand All\n            \r\n        View with Navigation Tools\r\n    \n\r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \n\r\n        \nWelcome to the Manhattan SCALE Software Development Kit (SDK).\n\r\n\r\n\nCopyright Notice\n\r\n\r\n\nUsing the SDK Documentation\n\r\n\r\n\nThis documentation contains API reference topics and feature overviews for the programming elements available in Manhattan SCALE. To locate the topics you need, you can use Search, Index, the Table of Contents, or the navigational topics in the documentation viewer. You can browse API reference topics using the hierarchy in the Table of Contents.\n\r\n\r\n\nTroubleshooting\n\r\n\r\n\nIf this SDK is viewed over a network and will not show any topic content, please refer to the following Microsoft Knowledge Base article for information on the cause and any possible solutions: http://support.microsoft.com/kb/892675\n\n            \n            \r\n        \r\n    \n\r\n    \n\r\n        \n\n \n\n \n\n\n\n©2026 Manhattan Associates. All Rights Reserved.\n\n\r\n    \n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \r\n",
